---
import BlogLayout from "../../layouts/BlogLayout.astro";

const title = "Pakistan FBR Tax Filing Guide 2026: IRIS Portal, Deadlines & ATL";
const description = "Complete step-by-step guide to online tax filing in Pakistan via FBR IRIS portal. Learn NTN registration, income tax filing deadline, ATL benefits, Befiler/Softax services, and amnesty schemes.";
const image = "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1450133064473-71024230f91b?w=1200&q=80";
const canonical = "https://finsiva.com/blogs/pakistan-tax-filing-guide";
const author = "Ayesha Malik";
const authorBio = "Chartered accountant specializing in FBR IRIS tax return filing, tax advisory, and corporate tax compliance in Lahore and Karachi.";
const lastUpdated = "August 2026";
const readTime = "16 min read";

const faqSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What is the official income tax filing deadline in Pakistan for 2026?",
      acceptedAnswer: {
        "@type": "Answer",
        text: "The statutory tax filing deadline for individuals and salaried workers in Pakistan is September 30 following the close of the tax year on June 30."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How do I register for a National Tax Number (NTN) on FBR IRIS?",
      acceptedAnswer: {
        "@type": "Answer",
        text: "You can obtain an NTN by registering online at the FBR IRIS portal (iris.fbr.gov.pk) using your CNIC/NICOP, mobile number registered in your name, and email address."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What are the benefits of filing a tax return and appearing on the Active Taxpayer List (ATL)?",
      acceptedAnswer: {
        "@type": "Answer",
        text: "Active tax filers on the ATL enjoy a 50% discount on withholding taxes for property purchases, vehicle token payments, bank cash withdrawals, and dividend payouts."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What tax advisory and filing services exist in Pakistan (Befiler, Softax, HQ Tax)?",
      acceptedAnswer: {
        "@type": "Answer",
        text: "Taxpayers can file directly on FBR IRIS or utilize certified tax consultant firms and digital platforms such as Befiler, Softax Karachi, or HQ Tax & Financial Inc Lahore for guided filing."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What is a Tax Amnesty Scheme in Pakistan?",
      acceptedAnswer: {
        "@type": "Answer",
        text: "A Tax Amnesty Scheme is a statutory asset declaration scheme periodically announced by the government allowing taxpayers to declare undisclosed assets by paying a concessional flat tax rate without penalties."
      }
    }
  ]
};
---

<BlogLayout title={title} description={description} image={image} canonical={canonical} author={author} authorBio={authorBio} lastUpdated={lastUpdated} readTime={readTime}>
  <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-body dark:text-muted leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              Annual <strong>income tax filing pakistan</strong> is a mandatory obligation for eligible individuals, salaried workers, business entities, and non-resident Pakistanis with assets in the country. The Federal Board of Revenue (FBR) conducts all e-filing through its official portal, <strong>IRIS FBR</strong> (<a href="https://iris.fbr.gov.pk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link hover:underline">iris.fbr.gov.pk</a>).
            </p>
            <p>
              Whether you plan to file returns yourself, obtain a <strong>national tax no pakistan</strong> (NTN), or hire professional <strong>tax firms in karachi</strong> or <strong>tax services in lahore</strong> (such as Befiler, Softax Karachi, or HQ Tax & Financial Inc Lahore), this guide explains the step-by-step process.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">1. Step-by-Step Online Tax Filing on FBR IRIS</h2>
            <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-2">
              <li><strong>Registration & NTN Generation</strong>: Access <code>iris.fbr.gov.pk</code>, click <em>Registration for Unregistered Person</em>, and enter your CNIC, mobile number, and email to obtain an NTN.</li>
              <li><strong>Income Declaration</strong>: Under Form <code>114(1)</code>, enter annual salary income, business profits, rental income, or capital gains.</li>
              <li><strong>Adjustable Tax Claims</strong>: Enter advance withholding taxes paid on mobile bills, electricity bills, property transfers, and bank transactions.</li>
              <li><strong>Wealth Statement (Section 116)</strong>: Declare personal assets (real estate property, vehicles, bank balances) and annual household expenses.</li>
              <li><strong>Verification & Submission</strong>: Verify your four-digit PIN code and submit the return before the official deadline.</li>
            </ol>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">2. Tax Filing Deadline 2026 & Penalties</h2>
            <p>
              The statutory deadline for filing individual and salaried income tax returns is <strong>September 30</strong> following the end of the tax year on June 30.
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li><strong>Penalty for Late Filing</strong>: Non-filing or late filing incurs a minimum statutory penalty of PKR 1,000 per day under Section 182.</li>
              <li><strong>Active Taxpayer List (ATL) Status</strong>: Late filers are placed on the late-filer list and must pay an ATL surcharge (PKR 1,000 for individuals) to activate active filer status.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">3. Active Taxpayer List (ATL) Benefits vs Non-Filers</h2>
            <p>
              Being on the FBR Active Taxpayer List provides substantial financial savings:
            </p>

            <div class="my-6 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas dark:border-overlay-lighter dark:bg-surface">
              <table class="w-full text-left text-sm">
                <thead class="bg-canvas-soft border-b border-hairline dark:bg-surface/80 dark:border-overlay-lighter text-ink dark:text-on-primary font-bold">
                  <tr>
                    <th class="p-3">Transaction Type</th>
                    <th class="p-3">Active Tax Filer Rate</th>
                    <th class="p-3">Non-Filer Rate</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody class="divide-y divide-hairline dark:divide-overlay-lighter">
                  <tr>
                    <td class="p-3 font-medium">Property Purchase (Section 236K)</td>
                    <td class="p-3 font-bold text-emerald-600">3% to 4%</td>
                    <td class="p-3 font-bold text-rose-600">10.5% to 12%</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td class="p-3 font-medium">Property Sale (Section 236C)</td>
                    <td class="p-3 font-bold text-emerald-600">3%</td>
                    <td class="p-3 font-bold text-rose-600">10%</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td class="p-3 font-medium">Bank Cash Withdrawal (> PKR 50k/day)</td>
                    <td class="p-3 font-bold text-emerald-600">0%</td>
                    <td class="p-3 font-bold text-rose-600">0.6%</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td class="p-3 font-medium">Dividend Income</td>
                    <td class="p-3 font-bold text-emerald-600">15%</td>
                    <td class="p-3 font-bold text-rose-600">30%</td>
                  </tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">4. Tax Firms & Digital Services (Befiler, Softax, HQ Tax)</h2>
            <p>
              Taxpayers seeking assistance can work with established advisory firms and digital portals:
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li><strong>Befiler Pakistan</strong>: Online platform assisting individuals and freelancers with IRIS filing.</li>
              <li><strong>Softax Karachi</strong>: Corporate tax advisory firm specializing in sales tax and corporate tax compliance.</li>
              <li><strong>HQ Tax & Financial Inc Lahore</strong>: Professional tax firm providing tax audit and return services in Lahore.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">5. Tax Amnesty Schemes in Pakistan</h2>
            <p>
              Periodically, the Federal Government introduces a <strong>tax amnesty scheme in pakistan</strong> allowing citizens to declare undisclosed domestic or foreign assets by paying a flat tax rate without facing prosecution or penalty.
            </p>
            <p>
              Visit our main <a href="/knowledge/pakistan-income-tax" class="text-link hover:underline">Pakistan Income Tax Hub</a> or review <a href="/knowledge/pakistan-tax-residency" class="text-link hover:underline">Pakistan Tax Residency Rules</a>.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-8 space-y-4">
            {faqSchema.mainEntity.map(faq => (
              <div class="rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas p-6 dark:border-overlay-lighter dark:bg-surface">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">{faq.name}</h3>
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-body dark:text-muted leading-relaxed">{faq.acceptedAnswer.text}</p>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>

          <div class="mt-12 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-canvas-soft border border-hairline dark:border-overlay-lighter dark:bg-surface">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">About the Author</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-semibold text-primary dark:text-on-primary">{author}</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-body dark:text-muted">{authorBio}</p>
  </div>
</BlogLayout>
